    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35333" root="قذر" body-key="q">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُذَرَةٌ</span></b>  A man <i>who shuns, avoids,</i> or <i>removes himself far from, causes of blame; who preserves himself therefrom.</i> (S, K, TA.) See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَذُورٌ</span> and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَقْذَرٌ</span>.

